#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:2
msgid "DaoAI 天眼系统简介"
msgstr "Introduction to DaoAI Video Analysis Platform"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"DaoAI 天眼系统是一套以 **AI 视觉工作流为核心的工业智能分析平台**， 帮助用户通过可视化方式快速搭建、部署和管理机器视觉应用， "
"实现从“数据接入”到“算法推理”，再到“业务决策”的全流程自动化闭环。"
msgstr ""
"The DaoAI Video Analysis Platform is an industrial intelligent analysis platform** "
"with **AI vision workflow as the core, helping users quickly build, deploy "
"and manage machine vision applications through visual methods, realizing a "
"full-process automated closed loop from \"data access\" to \"algorithm "
"reasoning\" to \"business decision-making\"."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"系统采用模块化工作流架构设计。用户可以通过拖拽和连接模块的方式， 将图像输入、模型推理、逻辑决策及结果输出等功能节点自由组合， "
"快速构建符合自身业务场景的 AI 视觉流程，而无需编写复杂代码或具备深度算法背景。"
msgstr ""
"The system is designed using a modular workflow architecture.Users can "
"freely combine functional nodes such as image input, model reasoning, "
"logical decision-making, and result output by dragging and connecting "
"modules to quickly build an AI visual process that meets their own business "
"scenarios without writing complex code or having an in-depth algorithm "
"background."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"当工作流设计完成后，工作流引擎会自动调度各模块运行， 确保数据在各节点之间高效传递与协同处理， 将设计好的算法流程快速转化为可稳定运行的生产级应用。"
msgstr ""
"When the workflow design is completed, the workflow engine will "
"automatically schedule the operation of each module to ensure efficient "
"transmission and collaborative processing of data between nodes, and quickly"
" transform the designed algorithm process into a production-level "
"application that can run stably."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:16
msgid "DaoAI 天眼系统持续提供并扩展丰富的内置模块资源，包括："
msgstr ""
"The DaoAI Video Analysis Platform continues to provide and expand a wealth of built-"
"in module resources, including:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:18
msgid "图像检测、分类、分割等模型模块"
msgstr "Image detection, classification, segmentation and other model modules"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:19
msgid "大型多模态模型（LMMs）智能决策模块"
msgstr "Large multimodal models (LMMs) intelligent decision-making module"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:20
msgid "规则引擎与业务逻辑模块"
msgstr "Rule engine and business logic module"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:21
msgid "结果可视化与告警输出模块"
msgstr "Results visualization and alarm output module"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:23
msgid "用户可根据业务需求按需组合使用，构建灵活、可扩展的 AI 应用体系。"
msgstr ""
"Users can use them in combination according to business needs to build a "
"flexible and scalable AI application system."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"系统同时支持多种部署方式，包括本地私有化部署与云端部署， 可适配工厂产线、边缘设备、数据中心或云平台环境， 满足对实时性、安全性及算力弹性的不同要求。"
msgstr ""
"The system supports multiple deployment methods at the same time, including "
"local privatized deployment and cloud deployment. It can be adapted to "
"factory production lines, edge devices, data centers or cloud platform "
"environments to meet different requirements for real-time, security and "
"computing power flexibility."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:30
msgid "通过 DaoAI 天眼系统，您可以："
msgstr "Through the DaoAI Video Analysis Platform, you can:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:32
msgid "使用先进的 AI 视觉模型，对图像和视频中的目标进行精准检测、识别与分析。"
msgstr ""
"Use advanced AI vision models to accurately detect, identify and analyze "
"targets in images and videos."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:33
msgid "在工作流的任意阶段引入大型多模态模型（LMMs），实现复杂业务决策和智能判断。"
msgstr ""
"Introduce large-scale multimodal models (LMMs) at any stage of the workflow "
"to realize complex business decisions and intelligent judgments."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:34
msgid "通过可视化规则模块，将模型推理结果快速转化为符合行业场景的业务判定逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"Through the visual rule module, model inference results are quickly "
"transformed into business decision logic that conforms to industry "
"scenarios."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:35
msgid "打通从模型验证、测试调优到现场部署应用的完整闭环。"
msgstr ""
"Open up a complete closed loop from model verification, testing and tuning "
"to on-site deployment of applications."

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:37
msgid "DaoAI 天眼工作流概览"
msgstr "DaoAI Tianyan workflow overview"

#: ../../source/quick_start/index.rst:44
msgid "下一步建议"
msgstr "Suggestions for next steps"

