msgid "在接下来的文档中，我们将介绍如何创建、配置并运行工作流， 并通过实际示例帮助您快速上手 DaoAI 天眼系统。"
msgstr ""
"In the following documents, we will introduce how to create, configure and "
"run workflows, and use practical examples to help you quickly get started "
"with the DaoAI Video Analysis Platform."

